  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "m19-s001",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4020,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Welcome, and Rafferty, welcome back in a new role."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s002",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-b",
      "startMs": 4270,
      "endMs": 12090,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Thanks. Two weeks in at Solvane and I already know more about solar inverters than I ever wanted to."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s003",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-c",
      "startMs": 12340,
      "endMs": 19400,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Rafferty reports to me, and I've asked him to own the integration side of the grid dashboard."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s004",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-d",
      "startMs": 19650,
      "endMs": 22910,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Which is a relief for me, honestly."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s005",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 23160,
      "endMs": 26800,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great. Kieran, where are we on the pipelines?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s006",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-e",
      "startMs": 27050,
      "endMs": 34490,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The warehouse model is done. What I need now is access to the historian API for the backfill."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s007",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-b",
      "startMs": 34740,
      "endMs": 39900,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll provide the API credentials for the SCADA historian by next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s008",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-e",
      "startMs": 40150,
      "endMs": 41130,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s009",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 41380,
      "endMs": 46160,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "On load patterns, do we stream or batch for phase one?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s010",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-e",
      "startMs": 46410,
      "endMs": 51570,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Batch is much simpler, and fifteen-minute freshness is already the warehouse cadence."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s011",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-c",
      "startMs": 51820,
      "endMs": 56980,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Then nightly batch loads for phase one. We don't need streaming yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s012",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 57230,
      "endMs": 60490,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Decided, nightly batch loads for phase one."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s013",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-d",
      "startMs": 60740,
      "endMs": 65140,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "For the pilot, we'll cover four of the fourteen sites."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s014",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-c",
      "startMs": 65390,
      "endMs": 69030,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "The four biggest. That's where the money is."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s015",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 69280,
      "endMs": 70640,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Which four?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s016",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-d",
      "startMs": 70890,
      "endMs": 74530,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "I'll send the site list after this call."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s017",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-b",
      "startMs": 74780,
      "endMs": 80700,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Also, the historian has a rate limit, so we should schedule the backfill overnight."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s018",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-e",
      "startMs": 80950,
      "endMs": 83830,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Noted, I'll run it after midnight."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s019",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 84080,
      "endMs": 86580,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Rafferty, how's the move going?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s020",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-b",
      "startMs": 86830,
      "endMs": 94270,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "We've settled in Lisbon. I cycle to the office now, which I never did in the old job."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s021",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 94520,
      "endMs": 97780,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That sounds good. Garnet, anything from you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s022",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-c",
      "startMs": 98030,
      "endMs": 103950,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Just that I want a demo before the summer. Early July at the latest."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s023",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 104200,
      "endMs": 106700,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "That works with this plan."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s024",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-e",
      "startMs": 106950,
      "endMs": 109450,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Yes, early July is realistic."
    },
    {
      "id": "m19-s025",
      "speakerId": "m19-spk-a",
      "startMs": 109700,
      "endMs": 115240,
      "rev": 1,
      "text": "Great. So: credentials by next Tuesday, nightly batch, four sites, demo early July."
    }
  ],
  "note": {
    "version": 1,
    "body": "# Solvane integration kickoff with Rafferty\n\n**Date:** May 14\n**Attendees:** Alma Mockwell (Larkspur Labs), Kieran Testcase (Larkspur Labs), Rafferty Fixture (Solvane Energy), Garnet Dummyson (Solvane Energy), Isolde Placeholder (Solvane Energy)\n\n## Summary\n\nKickoff of the integration workstream for the Solvane Energy grid dashboard. Rafferty Fixture has joined Solvane as integration lead and reports to Garnet Dummyson, who asked him to own integration for the dashboard.\n\n## Status\n\n- Kieran has finished the warehouse model and now needs access to the historian API for the backfill.\n- The historian enforces a rate limit, so the backfill will run overnight.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- **Nightly batch loads for phase one.** Streaming is not needed yet; fifteen-minute freshness is already the warehouse cadence.\n- The pilot covers **four of the fourteen sites** — the four biggest.\n- Garnet wants a demo before the summer, early July at the latest.\n\n## Action items\n\n- **Rafferty Fixture** — provide API credentials for the SCADA historian by next Tuesday.\n- **Isolde Placeholder** — send the list of the four pilot sites after the call.\n- **Kieran Testcase** — run the historian backfill after midnight.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Rafferty has settled in Lisbon and now cycles to the office.\n- Isolde is relieved to hand the integration side to Rafferty.\n"
  },
